-- ve-outreach-buckets: founding cohort email. Cohort 1 (Suggested for Vegans Explore, one address per person, 151 after leaving out the 16
-- flagged in docs/proposals/founding-cohort-1-list.md) as a BrandDesk people campaign. Draft: the email is not locked and the campaign
-- is not approved; nothing sends until Sean approves it in BrandDesk.
insert into ve_outreach_campaigns (slug, name, door, categories, vegan_only, note, status, start_on, cities, audience, email_count, daily_pace, sender_brand, link_path, footer_reason)
values ('founding-cohort-1-2026-11', 'Founding cohort 1: our strongest supporters', null, '{}', false,
 'People from the Suggested for Vegans Explore pool (HQ People), one address each, read by Sean before approval. From Sean. Invites them to become Founding Members free (Explorer survey), walk the Welcome Guide and send feedback. Playbook ve-outreach-buckets.',
 'draft', '2026-11-09', '{}', 'people', 1, 160, 'lesaruss', '/passport?from=founding-cohort', 'we have been in touch over the years about the Vegan community')
on conflict (slug) do nothing;
insert into ve_outreach_campaign_emails (campaign_slug, step, subject, body, day_offset)
values ('founding-cohort-1-2026-11', 1, 'Before we open the doors, {first_name}', 'Hi {first_name},

You''ve been part of this community since long before there was a platform for it. You showed up, you shared what you knew, and you said yes when it mattered. That''s why you''re one of the first people I''m writing to.

We''re opening Vegans Explore to a small group before everyone else, and I''d like you in it. If you have a few minutes this week:

1. Become a Founding Member. It''s free: a short survey, about two minutes, and you start with 250 points. Anyone who joins before midnight Eastern on January 1, 2027 is a Founding Member for good.

2. Walk through the Welcome Guide. Liz shows you around: the Directory, your city, events, the Guides and how points work.

3. Tell us what you think. There''s a Feedback button on every page. If something is broken, confusing or missing, I want to hear it.

Start here: {link}

You''ve helped carry this community for years. Now I''d love your help shaping where it goes next.

Thank you,
Sean', 0)
on conflict (campaign_slug, step) do nothing;
insert into ve_outreach_campaign_members (campaign_slug, person_key, person_name, person_id, step, send_status)
